name rsfso
category Package
revision 60849
shortdesc A mathematical calligraphic font based on rsfs
longdesc The package provides virtual fonts and LaTeX support files for
longdesc mathematical calligraphic fonts based on the rsfs Adobe Type 1
longdesc fonts (which must also be present for successful installation,
longdesc with the slant substantially reduced. The output is quite
longdesc similar to that from the Adobe Mathematical Pi script font.
execute addMap rsfso.map
